# CampusHub agent context

- Read AGENTS.md first; it is the authoritative policy for architecture, dependencies,
  types, security, and required checks. Do not duplicate those standing rules here.
- For lightweight code questions, search only src/ and client/src/. Use rg to select
  relevant files and lines before reading; never dump the whole repository.
- Respect .cursorignore for automatic context. Do not load historical verification
  logs, dependencies, generated builds, source maps, or lockfiles for source questions.
- Read docs/openapi.json explicitly for API contract work. Read manifests, configuration,
  or historical evidence only when relevant to the task. Never read local secrets.
- Express 5 forwards rejected controller promises to src/middleware/errorHandler.ts.
- Reservation hooks live in client/src/hooks/. Transport error normalization lives in
  client/src/api/campushubApi.ts; UI components consume hooks and render results.
- src/types/reservation.ts is the shared type-only domain declaration layer. Import
  or re-export these types from the client API module instead of copying interfaces.
- Record actual Lab 6 evidence in docs/lab6-verification.md, not in standing rules.
